an beings  yeah maxing out your credit card to buy  anything that speculative is generally  not a good idea ask me how I know is one  of the biggest settlement companies in  Canada it's like a lot of people show up  with that problem  oh yeah you yeah you've been on the  other side of that yeah I forgot with  your your past business yeah yeah so I  saw a lot of people uh not understanding  the basics of the credit card machine I  really hope you guys enjoyed that clip  if you want to watch the full length  podcast you can find that over here that  clips from if you're new to the channel  make sure you hit subscribe over here  and pin down below in the top comment  you'll find a bunch of useful links to  my website my supplement line books and  a bunch of other stuff have an amazing  day peace out

